+/*
+ * oFono - Open Source Telephony
+ *
+ * One HFP emulator in front of two modems, as on a dual-SIM phone: the
+ * headset has to see the calls of both, and its commands have to reach the
+ * modem the call is on.
+ *
+ * The real emulator, voicecall atom, GAtServer and D-Bus helpers are built
+ * into this test. The modem and atom layer is a small model of src/modem.c
+ * (atoms prepended, watches told before an atom's unregister runs, a modem
+ * going away unregistering and then freeing its atoms in list order). Each
+ * modem gets a scripted voicecall driver. The headset is the other end of a
+ * socketpair, speaking AT.
+ *
+ * voicecall registers its D-Bus interface, so this needs a bus: run it under
+ * dbus-run-session. Without one the test reports itself skipped.
+ *
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
+ */
+
